window.products.push({"id":704055,"name":"Mixcept L-Shaped Desk Computer Desk Large Corner Study Table Home Office Desk Workstation Desk,ZJ02-WA-MI(Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711p30NAeqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AMPLE SPACE-- (59+59)L * 21.7W * 30H inch; provides large space for work. L-SHAPED DESIGN-- Double Wide desktop of E1 degree solid particle wood with high resistance on scratch & friction, space saving, provide plenty space for writing, working, handcraft, gaming and other activities. STEADY & DURABLE-- Metal frames are in 1.2 mm thick, which is 1.5 times thicker than 0.8 mm ordinary ones, more sturdy than normal desk with heavy weights. MOISTUREPROOF-- Extra PC holder help to prevent your computer host moisture. NOTE-- Please loosen all the screws first, especially the place where the table top combines. Ensure every part is in the right position before tighten all the screws. !!!There are two addition protective board on the package, （ NOT the part of the desk）it only used to protect the product from damage during transit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711p30NAeqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixcept","source_asin":"B07LBMGJR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LBMGJR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LBMGJR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704056,"name":"Santa Claus Hanging Mobile - 10 Inches - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HA9e0VyTL._AC_SL1054_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HA9e0VyTL._AC_SL1054_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B001HMAU5A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001HMAU5A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001HMAU5A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704057,"name":"Houseboat Kings Smith Mountain Lake 30oz Laser Etched Tumbler Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Travel Mugs for Cold & hot Drinks with Leak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LCrHjcLVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smith Mountain Lake 30oz Laser etched tumbler feature stainless steel Double-wall construction, as compared to glass or plastic container, double wall vacuum insulation retains the hot and cold temperature for longer period of time. The tumbler consists of a removable lid and a textured sweat-free powder coat. The powder coat won't strip off and you can hand wash all you need without any stress. ✔ Features & Specifications: Brand: Houseboat Kings Brand: Houseboat Kings Map: Smith Mountain Lake Map: Smith Mountain Lake Capacity: 30oz (Ounces) Capacity: 30oz (Ounces) Quantity: 1 Quantity: 1 Material: Stainless Steel (Double-wall construction) Material: Stainless Steel (Double-wall construction) Grip: Anti-Sweat Grip: Anti-Sweat ✔ Available Colors: You will love the combination of fun colors & Lake designs. So many mix-and-match possibilities! Available colors are as follows; Black Black Blue Blue Green Green Light Blue Light Blue Light Purple Light Purple Orange Orange Pewter Pewter Pink Pink Purple Purple Teal Teal White White Red Red ✔ Benefits: Extremely light weight - Due to its light weight it's easy to carry around all day. Extremely light weight - Due to its light weight it's easy to carry around all day. Insulated layer - It keeps your chilled beverages cold and hot beverages hot for a longer period of time. Insulated layer - It keeps your chilled beverages cold and hot beverages hot for a longer period of time. Compatibility - Compatible with all Yeti accessories - tops, handles, and sleeves. Any Yeti accessory fits these tumblers. Compatibility - Compatible with all Yeti accessories - tops, handles, and sleeves. Any Yeti accessory fits these tumblers. ✔ Health and Safety: 100% non-toxic - BPA (bisphenol A) and Lead-Free. 100% non-toxic - BPA (bisphenol A) and Lead-Free. ✔ Notes: Rinse thoroughly with water Rinse thoroughly with water Please DO NOT put in Microwave. Please DO NOT put in Microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LCrHjcLVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houseboat Kings","source_asin":"B07Z466K9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z466K9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z466K9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
