window.products.push({"id":704066,"name":"Decorative Concepts Pineapple Home Welcome Tropical Fruit Front Door Large 24\" Metal Wall Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r0mIOSpoS._AC_.jpg","description":"These one-of-a-kind decorative home welcome signs will truly make a beautiful addition to your entryway or front porch. We offer three sizes to choose from and most signs can be personalized (just follow the \"Customize Now\" button for details). Images are NOT STICKERS rather they are baked onto the aluminum clock surface which provides a vivid high-gloss detail that you will love. Signs may be used in an outdoor setting however we strongly recommend that they do not have direct sun or rain exposure and are kept under an enclosed area. Each sign is handmade and proudly assembled at our shop in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r0mIOSpoS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decorative Concepts","source_asin":"B08J8BRY3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J8BRY3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J8BRY3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
