window.products.push({"id":704068,"name":"Aigostar Indoor Grill, 1200W Smokeless Electric Grill Non-Stick Cooking Removable Plate & Oil Drip Pan for Healthier Grilling, 5 Adjustable Temperatur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H-4Xpyy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 HEATS UP QUICKLY & EASY CONTROL: 1200W electric grill indoor smokeless with adjustable 5-temp (240℉-455°F) settings that can heat up fast without a long wait before a banquet. The heating element is spread across the surface to ensure that every area of the grill indoor is heated evenly from edge to edge. Preheat the grill at max temperature before cooking and then select your desired/proper temperature to meet the needs of different food, keep foods tender without overcooking. 🍤 SMOKE-LESS TECHNOLOGY: This smokeless indoor grill has a mindfully designed drip tray which cools all grease quickly and reduces virtually all hot smoke. Enjoy all the fun of an outdoor BBQ in the comfort of your home, grill food indoors without the smell of smoke polluting your apartment or home. Cool touch base and side handle, no worry about burning your hand when grilling. 🍖 EXTRA LARGE NON-STICK COOKING SURFACE: The cooking plate measures 16\" x 10\", allows multiple ingredients to be cooked at the same time, such as steak, chicken leg, kebab, vegetables and more. Nonstick surface make you cook with little oil without leaving burnt-on residue, easy to take the food. Deoiling design makes less calories and offers a health diet. 🥩 FAMILY SIZE GRILL: Smokeless electric grill indoor is big enough for the whole family party. Enjoy making grilled steak, chicken skewers, bacon, fish, kabobs, pork chops, burgers, chicken, salmon, vegetables and more! Optimal choice for BBQ, family meals, Parties, Holiday, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, Valentine's Day. The grill electric not only can be used at home, but also is perfect for picnics, RV, camping etc. ❤️ EASY TO CLEAN: Non-stick grill plate and drip tray can be removed and easy storage. All parts (except temperature control and base) are dishwasher-safe. Simply wash and wipe them by hands, make clean-up a breeze! Aigostar Korean BBQ grill is your MUST-HAVE for the smaller kitchen. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H-4Xpyy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aigostar","source_asin":"B0C1YJLDTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1YJLDTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1YJLDTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
