window.products.push({"id":704240,"name":"Bedsure Yellow Comforter Set King - Floral Comforter Set, 3 Pieces Kids Comforter Sets for Girls with 2 Pillow Shams, Fluffy Comforter Set for All Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MZ8CCJHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Botanical Design: The botanical gardening printed on a saturated shade of yellow adds a refreshing spring vibe to your bedroom and turns it into a cozy den. Comfortable: The 100% brushed polyester fabric on the comforter set is woven with 10,512 individual fibers per square centimeter, which brings a satisfyingly soft skin feel to the sleeper. Durable: The microfiber specialized dyeing process with washed technique protects the colors on the fabric against color fades while prolonging the longevity of the finished comforter. Safe: This floral comforter set is Standard 100 by OEKO TEX certified, ensuring the bedding set is free from harmful materials for extra assured sleep. 3-Piece Set and contains 1 Comforter(104''x90'') and 2 Shams(20\"x36\"). Easy Care: This reversible floral comforter set is machine washable. Simply machine wash on a gentle cycle separately with cold water. Air dry or tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MZ8CCJHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B0BR42RBGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR42RBGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR42RBGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704241,"name":"8 Pcs Reusable Glass Straws, 8\"x8mm Eco-friendly Drinking Straws for Smoothie, Milkshakes, Tea, Juice, Cocktail Straws, Multi-Color Mixed (8Pcs Straig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Iwm8dJVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Brighten up your home with these great reusable straws. Even unused, they look like a magnet. Great gift idea for acquaintances, friends and family on all joyful events. Gift for birthdays, weddings or for the next party. Everyone will be happy about the glass drinking straws and put a smile on everyone's face Your own colour for everyone in the family. The edges are nicely rounded for a pleasant feeling when drinking. So every drink becomes an unforgettable experience. The straws are characterised by their high quality and are easy to clean with the brushes. Of course, they are also suitable for the dishwasher. Dishwasher safe Borosilicate glass is a glass that is very temperature resistant, for this reason it is ideal for both warm and cold drinks. Glass is tasteless, unlike plastic, paper, bamboo or stainless steel, whether smoothie, milk shake, juice, cocktail or lemonade, with these straws, every sip is a taste experience. Shatterproof, almost unbreakable characterise these handmade borosilicate straws and convince with their very long durability. Specifications: Color: Transparent, Yellow, Blue, Cyan, Green, Amber, Pink, Grey Material: High Borosilicate Glass Size:200mm*8mm (Glass drinking straw 8mm standard with 5mm inner diameter.) Package include: 8Pcs glass straws + 2pcs cleaning brushes Please Note: These glass drinking straws are very durable but are to be used like any drinking glass with caution. Although not intended for children if used by children they should be supervised by an adult at all times. Due to hand measure, the size may have 1-2cm error. Due to different monitor and camera lights may cause slight color differences, mainly in kind of all colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Iwm8dJVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYthE","source_asin":"B09B52NQRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B52NQRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B52NQRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
