window.products.push({"id":704276,"name":"Space Heater, Space Heaters for Indoor Use, 1500W Electric Heater with 3 Modes, 3S Quick Heat, Thermostat with Overheat Protection, Space Heaters for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Z467oGrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[3 Modes Setting and 3s Fast Heat] Are You Winter Ready? It’s time to pick out a space heater! No need to preheat! Air Choice electric heater could quickly warm up the air around you within only 3 sec. With 3-Mode Setting, you can choose 750W Low Heat, 1500W High Heat, or just Fan as you like, which allows it to be used as an space heaters for indoor use in Winter or a cooling fan in Summer. Also, the heater for garage is perfect for personal use, which heats instantly and saves on electricity. [Overheat Protection and ETL Certificate] Safety is our first consideration! The electric heater with thermostat will automatically adjust the temperature to constant warmth, so there’s no need to worry about overheating issues or being awakened by high temperature at night, which guards the safety of your family. Besides, the portable heaters for indoor use have been tested by the professional team and it owns the ETL Certificate, which has guaranteed the safety of the electric space heaters. [Portable Design and Adjustable Tilt] With built-in handle and lightweight (3.1Ibs), this heater fan is easy to be placed anywhere in the room. You can move the garage heater easily from the floor to the table. With the 90°adjustable design, you can adjust the angle of the electric heaters as you like while using the indoor heater. Also, it has a mini body and bright yellow, which makes it become a perfect heater for bedroom, portable heater for office, and space heaters for indoor use. [Apply to Diverse Use] Are you looking for an heater with multiple uses? This portable greenhouse heater could offer your loved ones warm air! With the space heater, you can enjoy your hot coffee outdoors while watching the stunning sunset on your patio in Winter at Christmas. Besides, the electric heater could warm up your garage instantly in Winter or cool it down while you get up early for work in Winter Summer. With the sun-like room heaters for indoor use, you can enjoy life ALL seasons! [Easy to Use] Less is more! Without complicated operations, this heater fan is super easy to use for everyone. Just plug the portable heaters in, switch on two-button at the same time (one for mode choice, one for overheat protection), which makes your life much easier. Besides, the outdoor space heater adopts PTC material, so it has a high heat conversion efficiency, which makes the cost-effective electric space heaters saving electricity bills for you while offering warm at Thanksgiving .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Z467oGrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Choice","source_asin":"B0B38JFG9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38JFG9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38JFG9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
