window.products.push({"id":704344,"name":"Deconovo Geometric Pattern Panels Grommet Semi Sheer Curtains Jacquard Curtain for Living Room 52 x 63 Inch Red Wine 2 Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QwTsxei1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our jacquard curtains are woven from premium quality faux linen 100 percent polyester fabric and imported, which are durable and smooth to touch. The curtain has a substantial weight, making it hang wonderfully. These semi sheer curtains are sold in pairs, set of 2 panels and available in different size options to meet your needs. Each panel features 8 anti-rust grommets finished in silver. These beautifully finished decorative curtains are available in 5 colors. Our geometric curtains provides a beautiful 5 tone color variation and creates a calming atmosphere and embellishes any décor without stealing the show. They are perfect for all seasons and hang beautifully in living rooms and bedrooms. The smooth and soft fabric looks luxurious. With a beautiful contemporary geometric design, our graceful jacquard curtains will brighten and enhance your home decor. Easy-To-Care: Machine washable. Wash below 86F. Gentle cycle. Warm iron. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QwTsxei1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deconovo","source_asin":"B07MR4WTG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MR4WTG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MR4WTG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704345,"name":"TECHZOO Pants Hangers I Set of 2 I Space Saving Wood Closet Hanger I Great for Small Spaces I Closet Hanger Rack Organizer I Perfect for Clothes Organ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812AQP6UOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform Your Closet with Ultra Utility Hangers SET of 2 : Effortlessly optimize your closet space with the TechZoo Ultra Utility Hangers. Designed with versatility in mind, these hangers offer two unique hanging designs, allowing you to hang your clothes horizontally or vertically. Say goodbye to cluttered and disorganized closets and enjoy a neat and organized space with the strength and durability of these hangers, stronger than regular plastic or velvet options. Maximize your closet space. Experience Durability and Style with TechZoo Solid Beech Wood Hangers : Upgrade your closet with the TechZoo Solid Beech Wood Hangers. Made with GRADE A beech wood, these hangers offer a sturdy & stylish solution for your clothing storage needs. The hooks of the hanger are constructed with premium stainless steel & coated with a non-slip rubber, ensuring that your clothes stay securely in place in each hanger. The round & smooth edges protect your clothes from scratching & creasing from hanger. Optimize Your Closet with Versatile Hanger Design : Make the most out of any space in your closet with the TechZoo Hangers. With an easy to slide design, you can effortlessly balance your clothes vertically or horizontally, making it perfect for any size closet. Say goodbye to cluttered and disorganized spaces and enjoy a neat and tidy closet for years to come. The design is versatile, making it a smart purchase for any home. Make your closet proud with the TechZoo Hangers. TECHZOO's Multi-Purpose Hangers : Effortlessly organize your clothing with TechZoo's Multi-Purpose wardrobe closet Hangers. Each hanger can hold up to 5 pants, 25 ties, 5 skirts, & scarves. The rotatable 360-degree design saves up to 85% of your wardrobe space and keeps clothes in their natural shape without any wrinkles. Ideal for hanging jeans, pants, trousers, ties, scarves. Get the most out of your closet with TechZoo's Multi-Purpose wardrobe clothes organizer Hangers. Invest in Quality with TECHZOO Pants Hangers : Don't settle for low-quality hangers. Invest in the best with TechZoo's 12.0\" x 6.0\" x 12.5\" Wood Pant Hangers. Made with only the finest GRADE A wood material, these hangers are built to last for generations to come. Don't be fooled by others offering low pricing, make a wise choice with TechZoo and enjoy the peace of mind that comes with knowing you've invested in quality. Upgrade your closet with SET of 2 Pant Hangers and organize closet rack. Maximize Your Closet Space with TECHZOO Pants Hangers - SET of 2 : Pants Hangers are space-saving solution for your closet. Made with sturdy wood, these hangers are perfect for organizing jeans, pants, ties, scarves & more. Designed to fit in small spaces, they will help you maximize your closet space while keeping your clothes looking neat & organized. The Natural finish adds a touch of style to your closet and the sturdy construction ensures they will last. Get organized today and enjoy a clutter-free closet with TECHZOO Pants Hangers. Keep your clothes in great shape with the TechZoo Ultra Utility Pants Hangers. Add a touch of elegance to your closet with the TechZoo Solid Beech Wood Pant Hanger. The strong construction provides superior durability. SET of 2, 5 tier pant hanger each, maximize your closet space with these space saving pant hangers. Unbeatable Customer Satisfaction & Guarantee : At TECHZOO, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We offer a 100% customer satisfaction guarantee on our Pants Hangers. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, we'll do everything to make it right. Our goal is to provide you with a product that exceeds your expectations & a shopping experience that is seamless & stress-free. Invest in TECHZOO Pants Hangers with confidence, knowing that your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812AQP6UOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TechZoo","source_asin":"B0B9ZJ56CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9ZJ56CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9ZJ56CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
