window.products.push({"id":704381,"name":"Impressive Crystal Clear Glass Trifle And Fruit Bowl~ Footed Dessert Bowl ~ 85 Oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Eb7wrCWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don’t want to serve trifle in regular glass bowls? After all, presentation does matter, and trifle or any other dessert when served sloppily in ordinary bowls can totally kill the overall effect. This footed trifle bowl lets you show off your “work of art”, which is bound to impress your guests. It looks beautiful, so rest assured you will be complimented! Robust The trifle bowl is constructed with thick, crystal clear glass which enhances its sturdiness. The glass used here is of top quality. Aesthetic Effect The lovely glass trifle bowl blends seamlessly with other glassware and imparts an aura of sophistication. Even if you aren’t serving anything, the decorative aspect still remains, which makes it the ideal centerpiece for your dining table. Versatile Despite being used primarily for trifle, you can serve a variety of other desserts in it such as soufflés, custards, fruit & cream, and so on. Time to put your creative genius to work! The trifle dessert bowl is a must-have addition to your set of existing glassware. Don’t wait too long – order right away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Eb7wrCWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classy Glass","source_asin":"B01L08EZXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L08EZXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L08EZXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
