window.products.push({"id":704431,"name":"Large Round Ice Cube Mold,Ice Balls for Whiskey,Silicone Ice Sphere Mold Maker and Built-in Funnel, 2.5 Inch Big Ice Ball for Cocktail and Scotch,Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61odHq6QG+L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Key Features: 1. The crystal clear ice ball mold used in whiskey or cocktails can determine how chilled the beverage is and can affect how appealing it looks in the wine glass. 2. Food Grade Silicone Roud Ice Ball Mold,Reusable & BPA Free 3. A mini funnel makes filling easily without leaking and avoids over-filling. Silicone ice trays won't crack or break like stiff plastic molds after freezing. Soft material and quick open buckle design make release effortlessly. Ice Ball Mold Instructions: 1. Align the ice ball mold lid and press tightly (Just try a few more times and you will become more successful) 2. Inject pure water about 95% (ice ball will expand after freezing, so that the ice ball will be rounder.) 3. Stable put it in the refrigerator and freeze for 4-6 hours (Try not to shake the ice mold after it is filled with water) 4. Leave it for a while after taking it out of the refrigerator, it will easier to take out the ice ball Why Choose A Large Sphere Ice Ball -- If you want to enhance the presentation of whiskey you serve to your friends -- Big ice ball is melt more slowly compared to traditional ice cubes. -- The round ice ball could while keeping the drink cold for a longer period of time and ideal for minimal dilution of your drink. -- There are a few ice balls for whiskey to consider using because of how easy they are to make to ensure you can make an impression on your family,friends gathering. Multifunction: 1. Best choice for Whiskey, Cocktail, Brandy,Scotch,Bourbon,Liquor Drink 2. Creates Slow Melting Ice Spheres that are Perfect For Non-Alcoholic Beverages, Even Coffee. Freezes pretty much anything including jelly, chocolate","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61odHq6QG+L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTW","source_asin":"B08H83XL8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H83XL8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H83XL8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704432,"name":"Carbon-zeolite- Earth Replacement Filter for Korean Water Filtration System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eBZ6RuwbL._AC_.jpg","description":"The 4-Layer Earth Replacement Filter fits in the bottom tank of the Korean (gravity fed) 5-Stage Water Filtration System. It contains four stages of activated carbon, zeolites, silica sand, and ion exchange resin are highly effective in the removal of bad odors, tastes, and other compounds. Activated Carbon Carbon has been used since ancient times (1200 BC) to purify water. Activated carbon is “activated” by heat and oxygen to create a high surface area which absorbs a wide range of contaminants frequently found in water. Zeolites Zeolites are micro-porous, aluminosilicate minerals with a unique cage-like structure that makes them useful in many ways, especially in water filters. Their ion-exchange and absorption properties are used to reduce odor and clean heavy metals and other natural compounds from water. Silica Sand Silica sand is commonly used in water filters because of its highly absorbent qualities to remove granular contaminants, suspended solids and colloids. Ion Exchange Resin In water purification, ion exchange resin is used to remove poisonous and heavy metal ions, replacing them with more harmless ions, such as sodium or potassium.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eBZ6RuwbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Korean Water Filters","source_asin":"B00Y1Q6AJE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y1Q6AJE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y1Q6AJE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704433,"name":"TOETOL Bamboo Toddler Step Stool White Kitchen Learning Counter Helper Tower Ktchen Stool for Toddler 3 Height Adjustable with Activity Chalkboard and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BKlTOiwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREY BAMBOO MATERIAL & STURDY: The kids step stool is made of 100% nature bamboo. Two additional curved support feet enhance the stability and balance of this toddler stool. The four-sided railings provide perfect support when your children inside, so kids won’t fall out from high place. HEIGHT ADJUSTABLE DESIGN: This toddler kitchen stool suitable for kids over 18 months. 3 levels adjustable platform and 2-stage adjustable foot pedal allow to get the perfect height for children of any age, which could witness your kids growth. 2 levels adjustable crossbar with rings can meet the needs of children sitting and standing. EXTRA STEP STOOL & MESSAGE BOARDS : The kids kitchen stool with black and white activity board(chalk included).The interesting design allows children to release their imagination and creativity.There is a separate step stool under the toddler step stool.It can be used by toddler when drawing on the chalkboard/whiteboard, also be used by mothers to take the items from the high cabinet in the kitchen. KITCHEN STEP STOOL & MUTI-FUNCTIONS: The toddler standing tower is pretty useful to develop toddlers independence skills, it help your kids prepare food in kitchen, wash and brush teeth in washing room, have food in dining room and etc. SAFE AND EASY TO ASSEMBLE:The toddler standing tower have a large non-slip mat of the same size as the platform can be soft and comfortable to protect your child's feet from slipping.This kids helper stool is equipped with 6 small non-slip pads,which are attached under the feet.Helper stool keepers included for an additional layer of security.Easy assembly,installation tool and the detailed instructions are included in the package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BKlTOiwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOETOL","source_asin":"B0C68SJ349","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68SJ349","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68SJ349","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
