window.products.push({"id":704454,"name":"Butane Torch, XINLANYU Refillable Kitchen Torch Lighter with Safety Lock Cooking Heavy Duty Micro Blow Torch with Adjustable Flame for Creme Brulee De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evmsJePRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: FOR SAFE SHIPPING BUTANE GAS ISN’T INCLUDED 【Safe and Durable】This torch lighter is designed with a safety lock that not only prevents accidental ignition but locks the flame without having to keep your finger or hand on the fire button. In addition to this, all of the adjustments such as the nozzle, ignition, and flame button have been carefully crafted from professionally made materials. Furthermore, the long angled nozzle and burn-free finger guard keeps your hands and finger away from the flame. 【High Gas Storage & Versatile Usage】Our kitchen torch has the largest gas storage capacity compared to any other torch. The burn can last for around 30 minutes after you have used the ignition. This means you can use it without worrying about the gas running out quickly. This is very convenient for your everyday use, especially in your outdoor activities. For example, you can use it in baking, sous vide, searing meat, and BBQ, it also works for soldering, crafting, jewelry DIY, and camping. 【Adjustable and Continuous Flame Mode】Piezo ignition technology allow you to use a culinary torch at any angle with effortless one-handed operation. You can adjust the intensity of the flame, allowing the flame to reach temperatures up to 1371°C/2500°F. In order to use the torch, press the button to ignite and then press the safety lock button to \"off.\" This will allow it to stay lit without you having to keep pressing the button which makes baking and cooking easier. 【Easy To Use】This blow torch is very easy to handle. You can simply slide the safety lock to turn it on and ignite it with piezo ignition technology. You can also turn the button for flame intensity adjustment. This is a portable mini torch which is an extremely convenient device that can be taken along with you for many outdoor activities such as camping and barbecues. 【Fillable Butane Torch】Our cooking torch is refillable and suitable for any brand of butane gas. It can be used with either long or short nozzles. For butane gas canisters with long nozzles, you can fill the torch directly; for short nozzle canisters, you can use accessories to lengthen the nozzle and then fill the torch. In addition to this, our torches are airtight and exceptionally well closed, so you don't have to worry about liquid coming out after filling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71evmsJePRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINLANYU","source_asin":"B09VDNKN6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VDNKN6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VDNKN6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
