window.products.push({"id":704559,"name":"Space Heaters for Indoor Use, Oscillating Digital Heater with ECO Thermostat, 16 Inches 1500W PTC Ceramic Fast Heating Heater with Remote, 1-12H Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W6slyt2+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉【ETL - Certified Safety -Multiple Security Guarantees】--This electric space heater is made of V0 flame retardant material and comes with multiple safety features including tip over protection and built-in overheat sensor (shuts off the heater when it tips over or overheats), V0 flame retardant 2-prong plug. Besides, to protect the heating element, the electric heater will blow out 30S wind to cool it down after heating mode turns off. ✍【3s Heat up Quickly】-- Powerful 1500W PTC ceramic heating allows this portable heater to send out hot air in 3 second, making your whole body wrapped in toasty warmth immediately. When you come home on a freezing day, you'll want to get warm quickly to save your fingers or toes from the cold, the space heaters for indoor use will be a great choice for you. Along with wide-angle 70° oscillation to sweep around your 200 sq ft living space. 👍【Energy Saving】--When in ECO mode, our space heater will heat up to and cycle on/off automatically to maintain the temperature you set and save more on your electricity bills, and you could set a temperature with the 41-95°F thermostat in 1°F increments. 4 modes to meet your needs: ECO mode, fan only mode (used in warmer climate), low mode(750W), high mode(1500W) . This digital heater with LED Display can be used all year round, greatly saving you the cost of additional equipment. 🔕【Quite Heating】-- This electric heater greatly reduces wind noise to 40dB, keeping you feel like in a quiet library. Comfortably quiet to use in a bedroom while sleeping, it can bring better quality sleep to light sleepers in winter. It’s also extremely suitable for warming the room while studying, working, or watching TV, never worried about being disturbed. ✅【Remote Control & 1-12h Timer】-- This space heater is equipped with remote control in the distance for up to 17 feet, you no longer need to get up frequently from the cozy bed to adjust it. You can simply touch the panel or use the remote to set a 1-12h timer. It can run according to the time you set, so you don't have to worry about wasting electricity bills by forgetting to turn it off. Hidden carry handle provides max portability when moving the heater.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W6slyt2+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meilen","source_asin":"B0BBRF5BS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBRF5BS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBRF5BS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
