window.products.push({"id":704581,"name":"LEZEN Round Mirror 30 inch,Aluminum Alloy Frame Large Circle Mirror, Ultra HD Wall-Mounted Bathroom Mirror, Metal Frame Modern Wall Mirror for Bathroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518hWaJdPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSITILE DECORATIVE ROUND MIRROR: With a simple round design, it fits perfectly with any decor in your home. The high-shine black metal frame visually add depth to your home. It could be used as functional decorative wall mirror for bathroom vanity, for a fireplace, living room, or bedroom ULTRA HD MIRROR: The LEZEN round mirror is beautifully coated to provide clear and realistic images. The backbroad is high-quality MDF, with improved water and moisture resistance. Each mirror has been treated with a high viscosity, shatter-proof finish, giving you and your family peace of mind HANDCRAFTED: The handmade Aluminum Alloy Metal adds warmth wherever it hangs. A mounting hook has been pre-installed on the back. The hook has been hand polished and has a strong load capacity, ensuring the stability of the hanging mirror INSTALLATION AND PACKAGING: We have improved the mirror packaging. When you receive your bathroom mirror, you will find it packaged in a sturdy box with a very thick foam.The package contains screws x2 and installation instructions, which provide a detailed introduction to the installation process WORRY-FREE AFTER SALES SERVICE: If you encounter any problems during the purchasing process, please contact us at any time. We will be very happy to provide you with friendly service. If you find your round mirror damaged upon arrival, we will provide you with a full refund or free replacement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518hWaJdPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEZEN","source_asin":"B09T9FP2JB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T9FP2JB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T9FP2JB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704582,"name":"5 Piece Solid Maple Wood Dining Room Set | Full Kitchen Table Set with Table and 4 Chairs | Brown and White Rectangle Table with Eased Edge and Distre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2085.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mhwBGoZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carol’s Inspirations brings you the Bentley collection of skillfully designed, hand-crafted furniture that is made with exceptional materials for inspirational style. This Solid Maple Wood Dining Room Set is perfect for families and matches any setting from classic to transitional to rustic. 5-PIECE KITCHEN TABLE SET Complete set includes 1 table and 4 chairs. Table is constructed with a 16” leaf that extends the seating capacity to fit six chairs comfortably. Chairs are designed with an arch for added back support. Features a neutral Sandstone Brown finish that is accented with Antique White aprons and legs. Table: 38 x 48 x 30 inches. Measures 64\" long with extendable leaf in. Chairs: 18 x 16 x 38 inches HEIRLOOM QUALITY Made from real maple wood, our high-quality furniture is long lasting and designed to be passed down from generation to generation. Maple wood is known for its incredible strength and our furniture provides reliable stability without wobbling. Due to the natural beauty of real wood, slight variations in grain, color, patterns, and texture will occur. PREMIUM PROTECTIVE TOP COAT The high-end multi-step catalyzed varnish finish will last for generations and provides a very hard mar-resistant surface for protection against spills and other household products. HANDMADE BY EXPERIENCED WOODWORKERS 100% made in the USA, our furniture is painstakingly crafted by Ohio woodworkers who learned the expertise of fine furniture making from their skilled ancestors. Our first-class techniques are ages old to produce heavy duty, commercial quality furniture. FITS ALL DÉCOR STYLES Furniture set is designed to fit any style décor of your home. With the elegant two-toned color scheme, it is the perfect table set for any space. Worm holing, distressing, and tones of brown and clean white bring out the natural beauty of real wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mhwBGoZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carol's Inspirations","source_asin":"B09CDX1MHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDX1MHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDX1MHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
