window.products.push({"id":704796,"name":"Wilton Christmas Stack-N-Melt Candy Bark Silicone Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ujsqisFFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Create beautifully detailed candy bark with the Christmas Stack-N-Melts Candy Bark Silicone Mold. Gifting candy bark and serving it at parties is a breeze with this silicone mold and easy-melting Wilton Candy Melts candy. Just layer pieces of Candy Melts candy in the mold, microwave and then add in additional ingredients on top, like nuts, candy pieces or mini marshmallows. Create perfectly molded candy bark every time. Add the bark to a plate of cookies to display on your dessert table, or wrap them up individually as a gift for all your friends and family. Plus, this 4-cavity silicone mold embosses your candy bark with Christmas images and phrases, like Giving, Sharing and Jolly for an even more festive feeling. Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ujsqisFFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B00KKV40AK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KKV40AK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KKV40AK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":704797,"name":"Glad Food Storage Containers - Entree Container - 25 Ounce - 5 Count (Pack of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EJUEM3B7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Glad Food Storage Containers, Entree size, keep your food fresh and secure whether stored in the refrigerator, freezer, or on the go. Lids easily snap on creating a tight seal and preventing messy spills. The five 25 ounce containers are the perfect size for bringing an entree for a potluck party, packing dinner for friends, or for stocking premade dinners in the freezer. BPA free and microwave safe, you can safely heat food in these containers. Clean up is quick and easy because they are dishwasher safe. Containers and interlocking lids stack neatly to save space in your cabinets. When you use Glad, you know your food is receiving quality protection. Amazon.com GladWare Entrée Containers offer a convenient mechanism for packing on-the-go sandwiches and salads and storing leftovers. Made from BPA-free materials, these durable containers help keep food fresh and are microwave, dishwasher, and freezer safe. Designed with interlocking lids, they stack neatly in your cupboard to reduce clutter. GladWare Entrée Reusable Plastic Containers At a Glance: Medium, square containers with tight lids help keep food fresh Medium, square containers with tight lids help keep food fresh Safe for use in microwave and dishwasher Safe for use in microwave and dishwasher Can be used in freezer for long-term storage Can be used in freezer for long-term storage Interlocking lids help keep cupboards organized Interlocking lids help keep cupboards organized BPA free BPA free A convenient solution for packing on-the-go sandwiches and salads and storing leftovers. View larger . Reliable Storage for Leftovers and On-the-Go Meals GladWare Entrée Containers are ideal for packing sandwiches, salads, and snacks for on-the-go meals at work or school. The square blue lids form a tight seal to help keep food fresh in the refrigerator, pantry, freezer, or anywhere else while reducing the likelihood of leaks. The 25-ounce, square containers fit easily into bags, lunch boxes, and totes for quick meals at the office, at school, or in the car. BPA-Free Containers are Microwave and Dishwasher Safe Made from BPA-free materials, sturdy GladWare containers are microwave and dishwasher safe and can be reused. Interlocking Lids Stack for Storage For easy storage, GladWare containers nest with one another while the lids interlock and stack vertically. Simply set the first lid down, lock a second lid on top by pressing down in the center, and repeat for additional lids. This compact storage design helps you keep your cupboards and pantry organized. About Glad Glad is one of the most well-recognized and trusted brands in your home. With a full range of food storage solutions including wraps, food bags, and containers, Glad makes sending and storing food a snap, keeping foods fresh and intact. Glad also offers a wide range of waste management solutions that makes handling trash a cinch. The line includes bags that stretch to hold more, neutralize odors, and use less plastic, as well as recycling and compostable bag solutions. Glad is a brand you can trust for all your food storage and waste management needs. What's in the Box GladWare Entrée Reusable Plastic Containers, 5-Count Package of 25-Ounce Containers and Lids (Pack of 6). Find the GLAD product that fits your storage needs Food Storage Bags Containers Plastic Wrap","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EJUEM3B7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLAD","source_asin":"B000EG4TLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EG4TLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EG4TLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
