window.products.push({"id":704929,"name":"Golden Associate Disposable Paper Liner Square 100Pcs Large for 5 to 8 Qt Air Fryer Baskets, Non-stick Oil-proof Parchment Liner Cooking Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ruMnJqfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use】This disposable paper liner is really a game changer for air fryers while cooking or roasting. After preheating air fryer, simply place one paper liner and food in order. When cooking is done, pull the food out of your air fryer basket with no cleanup mess! No more scrubbing the grate for baked-on food bits. 【Oven Safe and Food Grade】The paper liner is unbleached and food-grade natural wood pulp made, waterproof, oilproof and heat resistant up to 428 Fahrenheit. No sticky mess to the air fryer pan. Once you’re done cooking you can just toss it away. No worries any effect on food flavor or air circulation. 【For 5 to 8 Qt Air Fryers】Make sure how large your air fryer is and choose the exact size of liner. The disposable liner is 7.9 inches long and wide at the bottom and fits baskets for 5- to 8-quart air fryers. And they even do work well in oven, microwave, steamer, roaster, to name it. While you’re cooking something far messy and greasy, you may double the liner. 【Fire Hazards by Improper Use】Do not place disposable paper inside the basket during preheating as hot air would blow the lightweight paper onto the heating duct and cause the paper to burn. Leave the air fryer empty with no liner inside while preheating. One more thing, place cooking paper on bottom and weigh down with enough food later. 【Save Time on Cleanup】The parchment paper liner is a must that saves you so much time on cleanup. No more having to scrape baked-on food off the air fryer basket while baking, roasting, cooking, or any serving food occasions. This is absolutely a less cleaning and great grease catcher for your air fryers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ruMnJqfEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Golden Associate","source_asin":"B0C45WLS6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-704929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C45WLS6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C45WLS6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
